    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2785810/extras/5dd3b03c9896ab231f49bd4e73529376.poster.avif?t=1715545972\" width=600 height=146 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2785810/extras/5dd3b03c9896ab231f49bd4e73529376.webm?t=1715545972\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2785810/extras/5dd3b03c9896ab231f49bd4e73529376.mp4?t=1715545972\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>You are a Road Engineer. Build roads and bridges to lead vehicles to destination.<br><br>Different vehicles (car, van, moto, truck, bus), different roads (normal, large, bridge).<br>Avoid traffic jams, stay under limited cost, optimize time or speed, reach a distance.<br><br>Every level is a specific challenge depending on available features, board size, and objectives.<br>80 levels with progressive difficulty.<br>A leaderboard by level to compare to best Road Engineers !<br><br>Try the demo to make up your mind.",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2785810/extras/5dd3b03c9896ab231f49bd4e73529376.poster.avif?t=1715545972\" width=600 height=146 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2785810/extras/5dd3b03c9896ab231f49bd4e73529376.webm?t=1715545972\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2785810/extras/5dd3b03c9896ab231f49bd4e73529376.mp4?t=1715545972\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>You are a Road Engineer. Build roads and bridges to lead vehicles to destination.<br><br>Different vehicles (car, van, moto, truck, bus), different roads (normal, large, bridge).<br>Avoid traffic jams, stay under limited cost, optimize time or speed, reach a distance.<br><br>Every level is a specific challenge depending on available features, board size, and objectives.<br>80 levels with progressive difficulty.<br>A leaderboard by level to compare to best Road Engineers !<br><br>Try the demo to make up your mind.",
